WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
Thailand, at dawn.

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.140
A forest monk walks his alms round.

3
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:09.300
He is celibate, and keeps 227 rules.

4
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.510
Japan.

5
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.500
A married priest leads
his temple in chanting:

6
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.540
Namu Amida Butsu.

7
00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:19.660
Different robes, scriptures,
languages and ways of life.

8
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:22.090
Yet both call themselves Buddhists.

9
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.280
So do the Thai forest monk and the married
Japanese priest follow the same religion?

10
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.800
In this mission, you'll set the
two traditions side by side,

11
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.940
and look for a shared core.

12
00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.640
Then you'll enter a burning house
and cross a river on a raft:

13
00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.870
two stories Buddhists tell
about their teachings.

14
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:44.130
Your mission: weigh up whether
Buddhism is one religion with branches,

15
00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.370
or several religions sharing a name.
